  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Malaysia 2024 &#x2013; Scoping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The region of Sabak Bernam in western Malaysia has seen a number of impactful flood events over the past years. The government of Malaysia has requested the Netherlands to assist in coming up with a innovative way to address these issues sustainably.This project foresees in the implementation of the scoping phase which will lead to an effective focus for the implementation phase.</narrative>
  </description>
